  "bodyHash": "d87394ec727f6dcc",
  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/all-the-compatibility\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"http://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/short_560350.svg?badge_style=flat\" alt=\"Curseforge\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fall-the-compatibility\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/all-the-compatibility?logo=modrinth&label=&suffix= &style=flat&color=242629&labelColor=5ca424&logoColor=1c1c1c\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/all-the-compatibility\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/versions/560350(266fff).svg?badge_style=flat\" alt=\"支援版本\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/ycRJJk8EXV\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/523112426913267713?color=282828&logo=discord&style=flat&label=&labelColor=B6BCEA\" alt=\"Discord\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/AllTheCompatibility/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"logo\" width=\"400\"><br><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/page_decorations/line_curved.png?raw=true\" alt=\"line\" width=\"2000\"></p>\n<h2>📖 簡介</h2>\n<p>本模組旨在透過補全所有可用礦石的缺失配方，並確保盡可能使用來自 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ato\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">AllTheOres</a> 的礦石/錠/粉&hellip;，來實現 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ato\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">AllTheOres</a> 與所有科技模組機器的兼容！</p>\n<p>再也不用擔心出現五種不同的錫錠或配方遺漏的問題了！</p>\n<h3>新增超過 3,000 個配方！</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/page_decorations/line.png?raw=true\" alt=\"line\" width=\"2000\"></p>\n<h2>📷 預覽</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/AllTheCompatibility/blob/main/src/main/resources/review_1.png?raw=true\" alt=\"review_pic_1\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/AllTheCompatibility/blob/main/src/main/resources/review_2.png?raw=true\" alt=\"review_pic_2\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/page_decorations/line.png?raw=true\" alt=\"line\" width=\"2000\"></p>\n<h2>🗃️ 依賴項目</h2>\n<h3>必要：</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ato\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">All the Ores</a></strong>\n<ul>\n<li>熔爐、鍊鋼爐、鍛造台、礦粉轉換配方、礦渣團轉換配方</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>相容（支援）：</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/assemblylinemachines\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Assembly Line Machines</a></strong>\n<ul>\n<li>研磨機、合金熔爐、流體浴槽、流體攪拌器、金屬成型機、氣動壓力機</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create</a></strong>\n<ul>\n<li>粉碎輪、攪拌器、壓製機、工匠檯、批量熔煉、批量洗礦、出水口</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/voluminous-energy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Voluminous Energy</a></strong>\n<ul>\n<li>破碎機、離心分離機、內爆壓縮機、工業高爐</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/industrial-reborn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Industrial Reborn</a></strong>\n<ul>\n<li>破碎機、壓縮機、合金熔爐、錘子、掃描儀、軋製機、廢料箱、洗礦</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ftb-industrial-contraptions-forge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">FTB Industrial Contraptions</a></strong>\n<ul>\n<li>研碎機、擠出機、離心機、軋製機</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/energized-power\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Energized Power</a></strong>\n<ul>\n<li>粉碎機、合金爐、壓縮機、金屬壓機、過濾廠、水晶生長室、液體轉置機</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modern-industrialization\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modern Industrialization</a></strong>\n<ul>\n<li>組裝機、離心機、攪拌器、壓縮機、切割機、鍛打錘、研碎機、打包機、解包機、內爆壓縮機</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oritech\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">OriTech</a></strong>\n<ul>\n<li>原子熔爐、離心機、鑄造廠、深層鑽機、碎片熔爐、粉碎機、粒子加速器</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ad-astra\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ad Astra</a></strong>\n<ul>\n<li>壓縮機、合金熔爐、錘子</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/applied-energistics-2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Applied Energistics 2</a></strong>\n<ul>\n<li>轉換</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/botania\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Botania</a></strong>\n<ul>\n<li>花靈、火之花靈、魔力灌注</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cyclic\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cyclic</a></strong>\n<ul>\n<li>破碎機、熔爐、固化機</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/plain-grinder\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Plain Grinder</a></strong>\n<ul>\n<li>研磨機</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simple-grinder\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Simple Grinder</a></strong>\n<ul>\n<li>研磨機</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/replication\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Replication</a></strong>\n<ul>\n<li>物質數值</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/allthemodium\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Allthemodium</a></strong>\n<ul>\n<li>支援所有機器使用的金屬</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-engineering\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Immersive Engineering</a></strong>\n<ul>\n<li>封裝機、由 ATO 新增：[合金熔爐、電弧爐、破碎機、金屬壓機]</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mekanism\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mekanism</a></strong>\n<ul>\n<li>由 ATO 新增：[破碎機、化學結晶器、化學清洗機、注入室、純化室、富集室、化學轉換]</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ender-io\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ender IO</a></strong>\n<ul>\n<li>由 ATO 新增：[合金熔爐、球磨機]</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/actually-additions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Actually Additions</a></strong>\n<ul>\n<li>由 ATO 新增：[破碎機]</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<p>當安裝 ATO 後，請在設定檔中關閉其他模組裡已包含在 ATO 中的礦石。</p>\n<p><strong>免責聲明：</strong>本人及此模組並非 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/atmteam/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ATM 團隊</a> 的直接成員</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/page_decorations/line.png?raw=true\" alt=\"line\" width=\"2000\"></p>\n<h2>🎮 我的其他模組！</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/additional-structures\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/Additional-Structures/blob/master/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"額外結構\" width=\"85\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bedrock-miner\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/Bedrock-Miner/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"基岩礦工\" width=\"85\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tool-upgrades\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/ToolUpgrades/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"工具升級\" width=\"85\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/all-the-compatibility\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/AllTheCompatibility/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"全模組相容\" width=\"85\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/customized-dungeon-loot\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/2291f5f13114f09294ce5e079f8a61b8a2617a8692e68ca453674e93f1982b62/687474703a2f2f692e696d6775722e636f6d2f427065525748442e706e67\" alt=\"自訂地牢戰利品\" w